WEBVTT

00:00:00.027 --> 00:00:03.926
Savannah Payment Service Bank runs a network
of agents.

00:00:03.926 --> 00:00:07.896
Every deposit an agent takes can look normal
on its own.

00:00:07.896 --> 00:00:13.779
This is an agent oversight evaluation, run on
the platform, on the bank's own data.

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:16.473
The data in this film is illustrative.

00:00:17.181 --> 00:00:20.505
Savannah is onboarded as an evaluation
engagement.

00:00:20.505 --> 00:00:26.089
Its due diligence is approved by a second
person, its data is processed under a data

00:00:26.089 --> 00:00:32.006
processing agreement, and the term and the
deletion date are set before any data arrives.

00:00:32.006 --> 00:00:35.995
Our external-manager film walks through each
of those steps.

00:00:37.595 --> 00:00:42.823
The payment service bank analyst imports the
agent register in one file.

00:00:42.823 --> 00:00:44.203
Eleven agents load.

00:00:44.203 --> 00:00:50.085
One row has no agent identifier, so it is
rejected, with its line and the reason.

00:00:50.085 --> 00:00:52.118
Nothing is dropped silently.

00:00:54.895 --> 00:01:00.901
The bank's data engineer loads nine customers
and thirty-six deposits through the upload

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:01.379
centre.

00:01:04.895 --> 00:01:09.324
The anti-money-laundering analyst runs
monitoring over the day.

00:01:09.324 --> 00:01:13.120
Thirty-six transactions are evaluated, and
none fails.

00:01:13.845 --> 00:01:14.542
One alert.

00:01:14.542 --> 00:01:18.234
Nine agents in one locality took thirty-six
deposits.

00:01:18.234 --> 00:01:24.504
Each was below five percent of the reporting
threshold, so none was reportable on its own.

00:01:24.504 --> 00:01:27.709
Together they came to one and a half times it.

00:01:27.709 --> 00:01:31.401
A view of one account, or one agent, never
sees this.

00:01:32.095 --> 00:01:34.887
The analyst downloads the findings pack:

00:01:34.887 --> 00:01:40.541
every agent ranked by risk, the network first,
with the transactions behind each.

00:01:40.541 --> 00:01:41.797
Savannah keeps it.

00:01:41.797 --> 00:01:44.310
Inferiva keeps only its fingerprint.

00:01:45.095 --> 00:01:50.315
If Savannah subscribes, the data stays and
monitoring carries on from here.

00:01:50.315 --> 00:01:54.212
If it does not, its data is deleted, with a
certificate.

00:01:54.212 --> 00:01:57.135
Inferiva files nothing with any authority.
